/* Hea001: GEOMETRIC_SET compound mixing three defective sub-shapes: (a) ADVANCED_FACE with tiny scrambled inner wire (sub-tolerance, wrong orientation); (b) OPEN_SHELL with face B same_sense .F. + shared edge in opposite orientation; (c) free EDGE_LOOP wire with scrambled edge order; ShapeFix_Shape orchestrator must converge over all three without looping */
